  "loading_differences": [
    "Preserve native Chroma collection enumeration/insertion order in exact-vector logical snapshots and restores, retaining BM25 tie order; Windows extended paths support the original deep storage layout.",
    "Supplement real task/output/feedback fields absent from provided events with attributed stable-ID events, never retrieved/applied context. Duplicate old event IDs are not replayed for delayed feedback.",
    "Namespace-load memora and memora.retriever to avoid unused facade/document processors and optional GRPO/HF policy imports.",
    "Load the official utils/llm.py after removing only unused top-level imports torch, transformers and azure.identity via AST; inherit the unchanged invoke/_invoke_azure methods, replace constructor with public-service transport. Strict Pydantic response schema generated by the same OpenAI SDK helper. Replace only embedding provider transport.",
    "Compose actual AgentMemory, ChatMemoryBuilder.build and official application ConversationSegmenter, matching LocalMemoraClient.add without loading unused file processors.",
    "Official LoCoMo application profile: segmentation, primary/cue anchors, history, episodic links, hybrid BM25, prompted policy four steps; no RL-trained policy.",
    "Logical Chroma snapshot exports all collection documents/metadatas/exact vectors and collection metadata; explicit-vector restore rebuilds BM25 without model calls.",
    "Public top_k controls native initial retrieval; policy-expanded working set and linked episodic memories remain in returned contribution.",
    "Provider failures caught by native fallback code are surfaced after the operation for benchmark validity; native algorithm fallbacks for malformed generated content remain original."
  ],
